# Marketing That Actually Connects

Focus: Growth

Outcome: One consistent voice

Keep your message the same, no matter where customers see it.

Managing your email in one window, SMS in another, and WhatsApp in a third is a headache. We connect them all into one smooth system. If someone buys through an email, we stop the SMS reminders automatically. It means you're always talking to your customers with one voice, wherever they happen to be.

Key features:
- Unified Inbox: See all chats in one screen.
- Cross-Channel Logic: If Email fails -> Send SMS.
- Attribution Tracking: Know exactly which ad made the sale.
- Audience Sync: Target your email list on Facebook.

Benefits:
- Better Customer Experience
- Higher ROI
- Less Admin Work
- Clear Reporting

FAQs:

Q: Does it work with HubSpot?
A: Yes, we integrate with HubSpot, Salesforce, Klaviyo, and many others.

Q: Is it hard to manage?
A: No, our unified dashboard hides the complexity, letting you see all conversations in one place.

Q: How do you handle cookie loss?
A: We use server-side tracking and first-party data to maintain attribution even in the post-cookie era.

Q: Does it save money?
A: Yes, by coordinating channels, you avoid "Double Messaging" and stop wasting ad spend on already-converted leads.

Q: Can we add new channels?
A: Yes, as new channels emerge (like RCS or Apple Business Chat), we add them to the suite.

Q: Do you help with strategy?
A: Our Enterprise plan includes a dedicated campaign manager to help optimize your omnichannel flows.

Q: Can I send images?
A: Yes, we support rich media across all compatible channels including WhatsApp, RCS, and MMS.

Q: Is it GDPR compliant?
A: We provide built-in consent management tools designed to help keep your marketing aligned with GDPR requirements.

